[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 24421.99, "timestamp": "06:47:01", "text": "私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24424.628, "timestamp": "06:47:04", "text": "えっと、どうやって手に入れたのか自分でもわからないんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24427.75, "timestamp": "06:47:07", "text": "ええ、そうですね、本当に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24429.99, "timestamp": "06:47:09", "text": "コミュニティタブを取得したいので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24431.75, "timestamp": "06:47:11", "text": "スケジュールのように投稿できます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24432.77, "timestamp": "06:47:12", "text": "すべて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24434.15, "timestamp": "06:47:14", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24437.83, "timestamp": "06:47:17", "text": "そして重要な発表において"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24456.708, "timestamp": "06:47:36", "text": "残念ながら、それはスキップできません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24460.39, "timestamp": "06:47:40", "text": "保存ボタンを追加してくれたらよかったのに。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24462.708, "timestamp": "06:47:42", "text": "それは重要です。"}]